OL,3,GNEWSASpeed limits and lane closures for
OL,4,AM6 viaduct works
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeed limits and lane closures are
OL,7,Fbeing imposed on a motorway viaduct as
OL,8,Fwork is carried out to replace its
OL,9,Fbridge joints.
OL,11,FThe #27m "essential" upgrade will begin
OL,12,Fon the Thelwall Viaduct on the M6 in
OL,13,FLymm, Warrington, on 1 September.
OL,15,FA full time contraflow system will be
OL,16,Fintroduced from 12 October, as well as
OL,17,Fa temporary 40 mph (64 kmh) speed limit
OL,18,Fand narrow lanes.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
