OL,3,GNEWSASpeed limits and lane closures for
OL,4,AM6 viaduct works
OL,5,
OL,6,FNational Highways said the viaduct,
OL,7,Fwhich crosses the Manchester Ship Canal
OL,8,Fand the River Mersey, was "built
OL,9,Fseveral decades ago" and the work was
OL,10,Fneeded for safety reasons.
